@startuml
title Build a template - draft models aligned with the team
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
!$showSaved = 0
!$showDraft = 1
!include shared/template-models.iuml

note left of WorkoutTemplateDraft
    No permanent template ID yet.
    An empty or incomplete draft is allowed.
    Editing produces updated snapshots.
end note
note right of DraftExerciseGroup
    Reuses the Exercise returned by search.
    rowId identifies this occurrence while editing.
    The number of sets is sets.size().
end note
note right of DraftSet
    Text allows unfinished user input.
    Each set has its own planned values.
    Empty-field rules and measurement units
    must be agreed with the team.
end note
note right of Exercise
    Existing team class; only getName() is shown.
    Full metadata is omitted because the supplied
    definitions disagree on scalar versus list fields.
end note
@enduml
